  "measured_at_utc": "2026-09-05",
  "how_measured": "Each D155 zip's tail was read by ranged request and the inner CSV name (AL_D155_<sido>_<yyyymmdd>.csv) taken from the central directory; byte sizes come from the bucket listing. The 34 DS00147 objects in the same prefix are D154 boundary shapefiles and are deliberately absent here (root ADR-0083 §1).",
  "why_this_file_exists": "The prefix piles up monthly vintages of the same 17 provinces — 207 attribute objects for one country — and the object names (20171128DS00148-N.zip) say nothing about which month or province is inside. Loading two vintages would double every designation row, and loading 16 of 17 provinces would look complete while a province is silently missing.",
  "consistency_check": "The newest vintage has exactly one object per each of the 17 province codes, which is what makes \"newest per province\" a complete national covering.",
  "granularity_counts": {
    "sido": 17,
    "vintages": 12,
    "objects": 207
  },
  "load_granularity": "sido",
